   "fix": "Move it, as a public lemma, to `TauCeti/RingTheory/Polynomial/Cyclotomic/PrimePow.lean`, inside the section that already has `variable {R : Type*} [CommRing R] (p : \u2115) [hp : Fact p.Prime]`. Then import it from `NormalizedTrace.lean`.",
   "issue": "`private theorem nextCoeff_cyclotomic_prime_pow` says `(cyclotomic (p ^ (m + 1)) R).nextCoeff = if m = 0 then 1 else 0` for any nontrivial commutative ring `R`. It has nothing to do with p-adics or traces, so it belongs in the cyclotomic-polynomial files, not here. Making it `private` does not fix the placement.",
